# Cloudflare Pages URL rewrites.
#
# sticker-as-civic-tag — the citizen-facing ribbon scanner is the
# microtext URL on every Z-SPAN ribbon. The pathname is preserved in the
# browser bar while Pages serves the SPA with the appropriate query.
#
# Syntax: <source> <destination> <status>
# 200 = rewrite (browser URL stays as source; SPA gets destination)
# 301/302 = redirect (browser URL changes to destination)
/scan /?view=scan 200
/audit /?view=audit 200
/corrections /?view=corrections 200
/registry /?view=registry 200
